msgid "Data Catalogue MOÚ"
msgstr "MOÚ Data Catalogue"

msgid "Data warehouse catalogue"
msgstr "Data warehouse catalogue"

msgid ""
"This catalogue serves as a registry of MOÚ data sources for the purpose of "
"their effective sharing and secondary use. The catalogue includes data "
"sources managed by the Department of Health Information, which guarantees "
"the correctness of information, data quality and provides support in their "
"use."
msgstr ""
"This catalogue serves as a registry of MOÚ data sources for the purpose of "
"their effective sharing and secondary use. The catalogue includes data "
"sources managed by the Department of Health Information, which guarantees "
"the correctness of information, data quality and provides support in their "
"use."

